         <title>CCDASTRO Workflow Manager 1.1.47</title>
         <description>
            <p>v1.1.47 fixes SyQon executable setup detection for Prism, Starless and Parallax.</p>
            <ul>
               <li>Uses the previously selected executable from existing vendor configuration when the workflow path is empty, without modifying vendor settings.</li>
               <li>Explicit workflow paths take priority; quoted paths and executable folders are accepted, and failures report the resolved path.</li>
               <li>23 regression checks and native PixInsight readiness checks passed. Interactive Starless inference remains subject to user testing.</li>
            </ul>
         </description>
      </package>
